{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "chatcmpl-tool-956ab3a172475513", "type": "tool_result", "content": "# AnyFlow: Any-Step Video Diffusion Model with On-Policy Flow Map Distillation\narXiv: 2605.13724\nAuthors: Yuchao Gu, Guian Fang, Yuxin Jiang, Weijia Mao, Song Han, Han Cai, Mike Zheng Shou\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. Introduction of AnyFlow, the first any-step video diffusion distillation framework built on flow maps, enabling a single model to support arbitrary inference budgets.\n  2. Proposal of flow map backward simulation for on-policy flow map distillation to mitigate test-time errors through efficient trajectory decomposition.\n  3. Validation of AnyFlow across architectures and model scales, establishing it as a scalable solution for high-quality, any-step video generation.\n===\n2503.20215\n===", "is_error": false}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "880fc986-7020-4816-81bd-00fc9d73bafb", "uuid": "f56c9f6e-80a8-4d4e-9dad-1d338cf0bd4e", "timestamp": "2026-08-04T05:38:07.805Z", "tool_use_result": {"stdout": "# AnyFlow: Any-Step Video Diffusion Model with On-Policy Flow Map Distillation\narXiv: 2605.13724\nAuthors: Yuchao Gu, Guian Fang, Yuxin Jiang, Weijia Mao, Song Han, Han Cai, Mike Zheng Shou\nYear: 2026 | Venue: \nTopic: \nStatus: unread\n\nContributions:\n  1. Introduction of AnyFlow, the first any-step video diffusion distillation framework built on flow maps, enabling a single model to support arbitrary inference budgets.\n  2. Proposal of flow map backward simulation for on-policy flow map distillation to mitigate test-time errors through efficient trajectory decomposition.\n  3. Validation of AnyFlow across architectures and model scales, establishing it as a scalable solution for high-quality, any-step video generation.\n===\n2503.20215\n===", "stderr": "", "interrupted": false, "isImage": false, "noOutputExpected": false}}
